Really fun game. It is an old one, but deserves attention.
Pros:
+ Open scenario, allow you to achieve goals with creativity;
+ Interesting story full of changes;
+ Diversity of weapons, vehicles and land/water/air choices;
Cons:
- Some challenging odds, a few shots and you are dead;
- Multiplayer down (it was released more than 10 years ago), so single player only now;
Totally worth the money and time.
Have fun!

